lunch, we recommend a picnic in order to enjoy the flexibility that offers in terms of time, as well as the beauty of sitting at a winery for your meal.  Calmart, Bella Bakery, and Palisades Eatery are all nearby and have great picnic options.  However, if you'd rather have a sit-down meal, there are also a few restaurants along the route to enjoy a bite, and we allot more time in your schedule for a sit down meal.\n\nPricing: only $94.99 + tax including bike/helmet/full itinerary planning/booked tasting reservations/wine pick up of your purchases.  (upgrade to the most popular electric assist bike option for just $50 add'l pp - you're sure to come back with a smile on your face with them).\n\nPlease note that wineries typically charge more for groups larger than 6 (plan on about $50+pp per winery). \n\nPlease note that tasting fees are not included in the pricing. \n\n##Package Overview\n- Comfortable hybrid bike with helmet, bottle cage, and rack bag large enough for personal items.\n- Knowledgeable and fun tour guide to lead, educate and carry all your stuff.\n- Unique and beautiful route for each couple/group.\n- Wine pickup of any purchases made throughout your day.\n\n##Itinerary\n- 10:00am – Arrive\n- 10:30am – Start biking\n- 10:30 to 3 - 2 tastings and lunch. \n- 3-4pm – Finish at the shop\n- 5pm – wine (if bought) can be picked up at the shop\n\n##What to bring\n- Comfortable clothes\n- Light jacket for AM\n- Money for tasting fees and wine purchases\n- Sunglasses\n- Sunscreen", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Ages 21+ • 3-5+ hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/calistogabikeshop2/items/542604/images/1187325/", "pk": 1187325, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https:/